      "skipped": false
    },
    {
      "id": "r1-smap5",
      "action": "wait_for",
      "detail": "We can also see a yellow note underneath the birth date that demonstrates how the eiConsole's Data Mapper can be used to perform data manipulation during the mapping process.",
